Description: RcmdrShiny dialogs for HH graphics and tests: two-way tables,
    best subsets, confidence intervals, scatter and lattice plots, Likert
    plots, ANOVA tables, hypothesis plots, MMC and projector options.  Derived
    from RcmdrPlugin.HH 1.1-49.
